Planet: Iron Cross
Clan: Axis

Notes: You have a large force without scouting components or defensive works. You have a complete set of factories but they have been cut off from power. You have no engineers and one Constructor. You also have several eco-spheres scattered over a large continent. Two opponents with seriously upgraded weaponry have landed on opposite sides of  the world map from each other. Each apparently wants your section of the planet. You are in the middle.  You must hold off the invaders until your constructor can get a Power Station working and you can get reinforcements made.

